WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.493 --> 00:00:06.804
Narrator: Most hazards are everyday ones: litter, cables, spilt drinks, a broken seat, a damaged barrier, a blocked gangway.

2
00:00:07.001 --> 00:00:14.002
Narrator: If it's safe and simple, fix it - pick up the litter, put a fallen cone back where it was.

3
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:21.215
Narrator: If not, report it and stay with it. Warn fans and keep them away until it's fixed.

4
00:00:21.315 --> 00:00:25.050
Narrator: A damaged barrier is serious - make it an urgent radio call.
